WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sw.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.910
Video hii inaonyesha jinsi ya kufanya

2
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.580
uchunguzi wa mbele wa macho kwa kutumia sehemu ya mbele

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.957
kitanzi cha pili cha kifaa cha Arclight.

4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Anza na usafi wa mikono na ujitambulishe.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Thibitisha

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
utambulisho wa mgonjwa, kueleza uchunguzi na kupata idhini ya kufanya hivyo.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Awali kuchukua

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
sekunde chache kutazama macho yote kwa wakati mmoja.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Angalia periorbitor, kope na

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
macho, kutoa maoni juu ya uvimbe wowote, urekundu na kutokwa, pamoja na umaarufu wa macho

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
au nafasi isiyo ya kawaida ya kope.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Kisha fanya uchunguzi uliokuzwa kwa kutumia taa ya arc.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Washa taa nyeupe na ushikilie kifaa karibu na jicho lako.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Polepole karibia mgonjwa

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
jicho la kulia kwanza hadi liwe kwenye umakini.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Hii itakuwa karibu 6 cm.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Muulize mgonjwa

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
kusogeza macho yao nje na ndani, kisha juu na chini, huku wakishika kope zao kwa upole;

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
akibainisha kwa utaratibu eneo tofauti la muundo, akiwafikiria katika vikundi.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Ya kwanza

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Kundi hili linajumuisha kope za juu na chini na kando ya kifuniko, pili ni pamoja na conjunctiva.

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
na sclera, na mbele ya chini.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Kundi la tatu ni konea, makutano ya hii na sclera inayoitwa

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
viungo, na

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
mmboni, akizungukwa na iris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Mara baada ya kumaliza kutambua miundo hii yote, endelea kutathmini kina cha chumba cha mbele.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
Chumba cha mbele ni nafasi kati ya cornea na iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Kwa kuangaza mwanga kutoka upande wa muda, kina cha chumba cha mbele

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
inaweza kutathminiwa.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Kivuli kwenye iris ya pua kinaweza kupendekeza chumba cha mbele cha kina.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Huu ni uchunguzi wa kawaida usio na kivuli.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Sasa chagua mwanga wa bluu kwenye mwanga wa arc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Kwa rangi ya fluorescing filamu ya machozi, maeneo ya kupoteza epithelial na ugonjwa yatasisitizwa.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Rangi ya fluoresces inang'aa na mwanga wa bluu.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
mchoro wa tovuti na ukubwa wa maeneo ya kupoteza epithelial na ugonjwa.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Imekamilika kwa kuchunguza sahani ya juu ya tarsal, weka pamba ya pamba kwenye kifuniko cha juu;

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
kisha inua mapigo kwa upole juu huku ukibonyeza chini polepole na kijiti.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Hapo awali ilizingatiwa kwa jicho uchi, kisha ulete taa ya arc kwa mtazamo uliokuzwa.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Rudia uchunguzi huu kwa jicho lingine.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Baadaye, mshukuru mgonjwa, kwa muhtasari wa rekodi za matokeo na kurudia usafi wa mikono.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Tafadhali angalia video zetu zingine za mradi wa Chuo Kikuu cha St Andrews Arc Light.
